('panaromic city tour + shopping + airport drop',NULL,'Hotel','Hotel','65',65,'Private Transfer',NULL,NULL,NULL,'10:00 – Leaving Hotel Panaromic city tour which starts with panoramic full evening city view of Baku followed by:  - Highland Park -Which is the highest point in the Azerbaijani capital, opening a panoramic view of the city and its bay. The city''s residents and visitors often come here to see a bird''s eye view of Baku, and just have a walk. The Upland Park can be reached by cable railway (funicular) in 7-8 minutes from the boulevard or by climbing up the endless stone stairs.  - Flame Towers -The city''s tallest building. The height of 182 m. Flame Towers - consisting of three high-rise buildings in the complex.    13:00 – Lunch Break   14:00 – Shopping Tour - Guests are free to choose any of below Shopping Malls:    • Park Boulevard Mall   • Port Baku Mall    • Ganjlik Mall   • Nargiz Mall   • Deniz Mall   • 28th Mall   • Crescent Mall    - Drop off at GYD Airport based on flight time',NULL,NULL,'Sedan - 4 Seaters (Local Speaking)',65.0),
