('shamakhi tour +  gabala tour',NULL,'Baku','Baku','71',71,'Day trip',NULL,NULL,NULL,'09:00 – Leaving Baku to Shamakhi (1 way x 2.5 hrs)   11:30 – Arrive in Shamakhi  - Visit to Shamakhi Juma Mosque - one of the oldest mosques in the Caucasus, originally built in the 8th century and restored over time. A significant example of Islamic architecture.    - Yeddi Gumbaz Mausoleum (Photo Stop) - Explore the historical mausoleum complex with panoramic views and photo opportunities.    12:30 – Lunch Break    13:30 – Leaving Shamakhi to Gabala (1 way takes 2 hours)   15:30 – Arrive in Gabala  Explore Gabala, a picturesque region surrounded by mountains. Highlights include:    - Tufandag Mountains – Scenic mountain range offering breathtaking views.  - Nohur Lake – Surrounded by forests and mountains, ideal for photography and short nature walks.  - Gabala City Center – Leisure time for walking or exploring local shops and attractions.    17:00 – Leaving Gabala to Baku   20:00 – Dinner Break (if included)   21:00 –Drop to Hotel   Overnight in Baku',NULL,NULL,'Sedan - 4 Seaters (Local Speaking)',71.0),
