('nizami street + indoor go karting',NULL,'Hotel','Hotel','35',35,'PrivateTransfer',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Nizami Street in Baku is an absolute must-visit! The vibrant atmosphere, beautifully lit streets, and a mix of modern and historic architecture create an unforgettable experience. Itâ$™s perfect for a leisurely stroll, shopping at high-end boutiques, or enjoying a meal at one of the many cafes and restaurants. The street truly comes alive in the evening, with its lively vibe and gorgeous lighting. Whether youâ$™re a tourist or a local, Nizami Street offers something for everyone. + Having a real and safe racing experience regardless of the    weather conditions are possible with Deniz Karting''s two    indoor racing tracks. The 2-story 460 m long racing tracks    for adults and the 101 m long racing tracks for children are    ready to give you the experience. Get ready to enjoy the   unique views of Baku while you race.',NULL,NULL,'Sedan - 4 Seaters (Local Speaking)',35.0),
