('nizami street + boulevard tour',NULL,'Hotel','Hotel','35',35,'PrivateTransfer',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Nizami Street in Baku is an absolute must-visit! The vibrant atmosphere, beautifully lit streets, and a mix of modern and historic architecture create an unforgettable experience. It is perfect for a leisurely stroll, shopping at high-end boutiques, or enjoying a meal at one of the many cafes and restaurants. The street truly comes alive in the evening, with its lively vibe and gorgeous lighting. Whether you are a tourist or a local, Nizami Street offers something for everyone.',NULL,NULL,'Sedan - 4 Seaters (Local Speaking)',35.0),
