('heyder aliyev centre + airport drop',NULL,'Hotel','Hotel','41',41,'PrivateTransfer',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Visit to Heydar Aliyev Center for PHOTO SHOOTING    & “I LOVE BAKUsign for PHOTOSTOP (entry to Vintage Car Museums)   (If it is first time of your arrival to Baku, just be aware of    that from the bird view you can clearly see the Heydar    Aliyev Signature on the Heydar Aliyev Center design.    It is a wave-like building rises from a bed of concrete.   Its immobile white walls look as though they have been    frozen mid-ripple. The abstract architecture is unlike anything    else in the capital city. The Heydar Aliyev Center, which was    designed by renowned architect Zaha Hadid.)',NULL,NULL,'Sedan - 4 Seaters (Local Speaking)',41.0),
